# Secrets and sensitive files
# Note: The actual secrets file is at ~/.config/secrets/env (outside this repo)
# but we exclude these patterns in case any secrets are accidentally created here
# Exceptions: agenix recipients manifest and *encrypted* .age files are safe to commit
secrets/*
!secrets/secrets.nix
!secrets/*.age
*.secret
*.key
.env
.env.local

# Build artifacts
result
result-*

# Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
PROGRESS.md
.ralph/
PROMPT_plan.md
PROMPT_build.md
